    "excerpt": "Saltmere::Tides - tide predictions for Saltmere Harbour Version 0.42 Saltmere::Tides predicts high and low water from the harbour's harmonic constants. See Saltmere::Charts and the boardhttps://board.example.org/. Creates a predictor. Returns the next high water as an epoch. <p>Tide <em>tables</em>.</p> Ada Quayside This library is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the…",
